    {
      "id": "blk_a9346e37",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "「星炬学院」学生宣言",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_eec0b047",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "于「星炬」之下，我们彼此立约：承续星炬的薪火，与志同道合的伙伴并肩，共拓知识的疆界。每一次对真理的探求，都将化作点亮天幕的星火，直至长夜褪去——我们终将携手，筑就属于我们的黎明。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8a139bb8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一、学院学制",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_73b2729d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "学院实行“2年预科＋4年专精”的培养体系。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_83b84ab8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 预科阶段（前2年）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0829a426",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "除拉贝尔学部的「适格者」外，全体学生须接受跨学科通识教育，内容涵盖基础学科、人文社科及拉海洛必备生存技能。学部分配将于预科结束时，综合学生意向与学业表现统一确定。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8933635e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "特殊说明：拉贝尔学部的「适格者」自入学即确定学部归属，享有专属培养方案，不参与预科通识课程。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e4794346",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 专精阶段（后4年）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_176ddd2b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "以培养科研专才为目标，鼓励学生融入课题组，践行“学研并进”。学院将为有意留校发展的优秀学子提供全方位支持。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5cb4999d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "二、学部架构",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b0e74a41",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "星炬学院以「隧者」及拉海洛独特生态为核心研究对象，依研究领域划分为四个学部：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d9323c48",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 拉贝尔学部",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3d020603",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "（共感训练学科群／文明协同学科群）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e8589aa0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "专注隧者外源性共鸣者的选拔与培养。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_eb4fe71e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "学部以拉贝尔曲线发明者史考特·拉贝尔之名命名，采用严谨量化手段为适格者提供顶尖科研教育，素有“适格者学部”之称。作为学院核心，其研究成果已衍生出多项关键技术，为各学科提供了新的科研基础。学部配备由隧者零件与神经元构建的模拟驾驶舱，可模拟驾驭隧者的同频负荷。为保障安全而研发的适格者监测技术，已通过下属共鸣医疗科转化为“频率医疗”体系，服务于全院师生。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1a05eee3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 隧者工学部",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_071504ec",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "（机体共融学科群／战术开发学科群）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2c03fb0a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "聚焦机械共融与战术装备研发。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d018668a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "学部基于隧者部件的自我增殖特性，开展新型智械与模块化武器研究，并致力于研究实战环境下的模拟验证。该学部同时承担通过外部零件搜寻与人工培育，加速隧者修复进程的重要使命。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1647a843",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 虚质科学部",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_06c3470a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "（空间异变学科群）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ab9247c7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "探索空间异变与虚质特性。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ce363fa1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "学部从隧者研究中开发出一系列的通信与空间锚定技术，以实现跨维定位隧者，以及监测适格者的生命体征。同时，学部以解析「海蚀现象」生成逻辑为核心课题，通过对拉海洛地区虚质磁暴的观测，并辅以对其他地区海蚀现象的数据分析，力求能建立起有效的灾难预警机制。在此领域，学部与黑海岸保持着深度合作。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_337b741d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "· 光矩能源学部",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_77f33a0f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "（光能矩阵学科群／生态维持学科群）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_04d826a0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "致力于光能转化与生态维序研究。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7ac796d6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "光能矩阵学科群通过模拟引日神殿的透镜原理，研究炉光能源的转化与存储，以供给学院内各项设施的驱动；生态维持学科群因研究场所位于“地外之壤”，且研究方向与声态保育密切相关，素有“农学部”之别称。学科群通过隧群的行为学研究，以窥见隧者知能与其代码对拉海洛声态重构的重要作用。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 28,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 29,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
